<title>ISRAEL: Israel's Sept budget deficit 87 mln shekels.</title>
<headline>Israel's Sept budget deficit 87 mln shekels.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel posted a budget deficit, excluding credit, of 87 million shekels in September, preliminary figures from the Treasury show.</p>
<p>			(in millions of shekels)</p>
<p>		     Sept 1996    Aug 1996     Sept 1995</p>
<p>Budget balance	  -87	-2,089	  na</p>
<p>Expenditures	 10,260	10,051	  na</p>
<p>Receipts	     10,170	 7,962	  na</p>
<p>The deficit for the first nine months of 1996 totalled 8.9 billion shekels. The government's target for all of 1996 is 7.6 billion shekels.</p>
<p>($1 = 3.19 shekels)</p>
<p>- Tel Aviv newsroom, 972-3-537-2211</p>
